Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.01,0:00:09.78,Main,Desir,0,0,0,,La mia analisi inversa\Nle ha coperte tutte.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.38,0:00:13.66,Main,Desir,0,0,0,,E mi riferisco a ogni magia\Nutilizzabile con quell'Artefatto.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.08,0:00:17.58,Main,Desir,0,0,0,,Hai perso.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.37,0:00:50.00,Main,Zod,0,0,0,,Che tipo fastidioso.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:22.50,0:02:26.50,sign,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(731,0)\fscx80\fscy80\bord0\blur3\t(225,726,\blur0)\an2\c&HEAFFE9&\b1\3c&H568539&\3a&H30&\pos(300.99,306.33)}Episodio 19
